		<div class="mpgtitle" >
		<h2 class="hdline"><a href="https://emrd.ntust.edu.tw/p/412-1039-7708.php?Lang=zh-tw" title='[招生公告] EMRD碩士在職專班 111學年度招生開跑(另開新視窗)' >[招生公告] EMRD碩士在職專班 111學年度招生開跑</a></h2>
		</div>
		<div class="mcont">
			

			

<div class="mpgdetail">
	
		
 		
		
		
		
	
	 
		<div class="meditor"><h1><strong><span style="font-family:微軟正黑體;"><span style="font-size:1.75em;"><span style="color:#000099;"><span style="text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span style="font-size:1.25em;"><img alt="banner" height="328" src="/var/file/39/1039/img/2483/110.png" width="1000" /></span></h1>

<h1><span style="font-size:1.25em;"></span><strong><span style="font-family:微軟正黑體;"><span style="font-size:1.75em;"><span style="color:#000099;"><span style="text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">📣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>EMRD碩士在職專班，110年招生即將開跑囉<span style="text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-caps:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="letter-spacing:normal"><span style="orphans:2"><span style="text-transform:none"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="widows:2"><span style="word-spacing:0px"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">📣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><br />
<span style="font-size:1.125em;">跨領域課程，堅強師資合授，培育研發管理人才，連結產業跨界進化！<br />
一年僅一次招生，加入EMRD，一起迎戰精彩未來🌈<br />
<em>今年度因應疫情，不舉辦實體招生說明會，相關招生資訊請關注網站<u><a href="https://emrd.ntust.edu.tw/p/412-1039-7708.php?Lang=zh-tw" target="_blank" title="招生資訊"><span style="color:#2980b9;">招生資訊</span></a></u>或<u><a href="https://www.facebook.com/EMRDofNTUST/" target="_blank" title="EMRD FB"><span style="color:#2980b9;">FB粉專</span></a></u>資訊。</em></span></h1>

<p><span style="font-size:1.25em;"><span style="color:#000099;">🎯報名時間&amp;系統</span><span style="color:#000066;">：</span></span><span style="color:#c0392b;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.5em;">109.12.04 ~ 12.18</span></strong></span><span style="font-size:1.25em;"><span style="color:#000066;"></span>&nbsp;(請至<u><a href="http://www.ntust.edu.tw/110entry2/" target="_blank" title="報名系統"><span style="color:#2980b9;"><strong>網路報名</strong></span></a></u>，逾期不受理)<br />
<span style="color:#000099;">🎯報名簡章：</span>110年簡章&nbsp;<u><a href="https://www.admission.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/52/1052/img/2675/667126014.pdf" target="_blank" title="報名簡章"><span style="color:#2980b9;">https://bit.ly/362DvTf </span></a></u><br />
